#: ../../source/docs/plane-navigation-overview.rst:5
#: eaf0b69c5b3e4a549dd51ea80b5e68fb
msgid "Plane Navigation and Altitude Control Overview"
msgstr "固定翼导航与高度控制概述"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-navigation-overview.rst:8
#: 86ec75f268f54b57a68383f6a99538f4
msgid "Navigation"
msgstr "导航"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-navigation-overview.rst:9
#: e6c4631d734048758ca31e959b260097
msgid ""
"In auto-navigating modes like AUTO and CRUISE, or when responding to MAVLink"
" navigation commands, ArduPlane usually uses two WAYPOINT locations (see "
"`location object "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Common/Location.h>`__)"
" and flies a wind compensated path between them:"
msgstr ""
"在 AUTO 和 CRUISE 等自动导航模式下，或响应 MAVLink 导航命令时，ArduPlane 通常使用两个航点位置（参见 `location"
" 对象 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Common/Location.h>`__），并在它们之间飞行经风补偿的路径："

#: ../../source/docs/plane-navigation-overview.rst:11
#: c218996b29f84219b298e1ef8eb55aa7
msgid "``next_WP``: the destination"
msgstr "``next_WP``：目的地"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-navigation-overview.rst:12
#: 8163505712b544218b648dc7a005b834
msgid "``prev_WP``: the beginning point"
msgstr "``prev_WP``：起始点"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-navigation-overview.rst:17
#: 5897f719e8824e58a394c765ef553ddd
msgid ""
"The code usually uses ``do_xxx`` to setup these waypoints (see `commands "
"logic module "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduPlane/commands_logic.cpp>`__)."
" Sometimes, rather than having an existing starting point to use as "
"``prev_WP``, code can use the ``set_``next_WP```` method using "
"``auto_state.next_WP_crosstrack`` variable value to set the ``prev_WP`` to "
"either the current waypoint destination (``next_WP``), or current location. "
"Usually, you want to have the crosstrack false for the first waypoint so you"
" proceed directly from your current position, instead of tracking to the "
"line from a previously set destination. When entering a new mode, the "
"``prev_WP`` is always set to the current location, and crosstracking is "
"initially disabled to assure navigation directly to whatever the new "
"``next_WP`` is set by the mode."
msgstr ""
"代码通常使用 ``do_xxx`` 来设置这些航点（参见 `命令逻辑模块 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduPlane/commands_logic.cpp>`__）。有时，代码可能没有现成的起始点用作"
" ``prev_WP``，可以使用 ``set_``next_WP```` 方法，利用 "
"``auto_state.next_WP_crosstrack`` 变量值将 ``prev_WP`` "
"设置为当前航点目的地（``next_WP``）或当前位置。通常，对于第一个航点，您希望将 crosstrack 设为 "
"false，以便直接从当前位置出发，而不是追踪来自先前设定目的地的路线。进入新模式时，``prev_WP`` 始终设置为当前位置，且 "
"crosstracking 最初被禁用，以确保直接导航到该模式设定的新 ``next_WP``。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-navigation-overview.rst:19
#: b8373ef7c95747a28c9774b3b150cc2e
msgid ""
"Auto-navigating modes call their ``navigation method``, usually involving a "
"``verify_xxx`` command, to determine if the destination has been reached and"
" setup the next destination, if needed. Determining course correction and "
"navigation roll angles is done by the `L1 Controller "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_L1_Control>`__"
" ."
msgstr ""
"自动导航模式调用其「导航方法」（通常涉及 ``verify_xxx`` "
"命令）来确定是否已到达目的地，并在需要时设置下一个目的地。航向修正和导航滚转角的计算由 `L1 控制器 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_L1_Control>`__"
" 完成。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-navigation-overview.rst:21
#: c67bce5a9348467097c4f9bd4d0a2d48
msgid ""
"`AP_Common:Location.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Common/Location.h>`__"
" has many useful methods for manipulation locations."
msgstr ""
"`AP_Common:Location.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Common/Location.h>`__"
" 具有许多用于操作位置的实用方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-navigation-overview.rst:24
#: e5a9592ce5e24f088beea2e803e97611
msgid "Altitude Control"
msgstr "高度控制"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-navigation-overview.rst:26
#: 57c5832c060e40c8b1ad1bd422e6023b
msgid ""
"Altitude control is managed by :ref:`tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-"
"speed-height-tuning-guide` using demanded altitude from the mode, in "
"altitude controlled mode. Modes use the ``update_target_altitude`` to "
"calculate demanded altitude for TECS which will calculate the altitude "
"profile between waypoints(`setup_glide_slope "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduPlane/altitude.cpp#L55>`__"
" or maintain current altitude. Altitude target can be changed by MAVLink "
"command (DO_CHANGE_ALT) or by stick control using "
"``update_fbwb_speed_height`` method."
msgstr ""
"高度控制由 :ref:`tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide` "
"在高度控制模式下使用来自飞行模式的目标高度进行管理。各飞行模式使用 ``update_target_altitude`` 计算 TECS "
"所需的目标高度，TECS 将计算航点之间的高度剖面（`setup_glide_slope "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduPlane/altitude.cpp#L55>`__）或保持当前高度。高度目标可通过"
" MAVLink 命令（DO_CHANGE_ALT）或使用 ``update_fbwb_speed_height`` 方法的摇杆控制来更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-navigation-overview.rst:28
#: 336b9cc8321e4d90ab32df374481ca85
msgid ""
"if you are actually moving away from the next waypoint, as usually the case "
"if RTL climbing before turning toward home option is set, the prev_WP will "
"have to be continuously reset to present position and the glide slope re-"
"setup in order to continue to climb."
msgstr ""
"如果飞机实际上正在远离下一个航点（通常在设置了 RTL 先爬升再转向返航点选项时出现此情况），则需要持续将 prev_WP "
"重置为当前位置并重新设置滑翔坡度，以便继续爬升。"
